## Layers

```
Adapter (in)  →  Port (in)  →  Domain Service  →  Port (out)  →  Adapter (out)
     ↑                                                                    ↑
  (Web, REST)                                                      (JPA, DB, …)
```

- `domain/model/` — Domain entities (pure Java, no annotations)
- `domain/port/in/` — Use case interfaces (input ports)
- `domain/port/out/` — Repository interfaces (output ports)
- `domain/service/` — Domain services implementing input ports
- `adapter/in/web/` — REST controllers, DTOs (driving adapters)
- `adapter/out/persistence/` — JPA entities, repository implementations (driven adapters)

